# ASR/forced-alignment model binaries, third-party toolchains, and vendored
# python wheels under .subfix_support/. These are large (multi-GB) build
# artifacts, not source — never commit them. The curated JSON profiles and
# the Lua core under .subfix_support/ (not covered by these patterns) ARE
# tracked as training/config data.
.subfix_support/qwen3-asr.cpp/
.subfix_support/models/
.subfix_support/hf/
.subfix_support/python-tools/

# 豆包(火山引擎)云端 ASR 真实密钥，绝不进 git。仅追踪
# doubao_credentials.json.example 模板。两条模式覆盖仓库根(与 helper .py 同级)
# 与部署布局下的 .subfix_support/ 等任意子目录。
doubao_credentials.json
**/doubao_credentials.json

# 运行时生成的生成偏好（记住上次识别模型等），不进 git。
